{"name":"Sunless tan injections ('tan jabs')","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":23,"casual":{"lead":["Tan jabs are unlicensed melanotan injections that people use to darken skin with little or no sun. The appeal is a deeper, longer-lasting tan without hours in the sun or a bed.","Melanotan peptides are synthetic analogues of alpha-MSH, the hormone that drives melanin production, so melanocytes make more pigment. They have never been approved as tanning drugs. Health agencies began warning against them in 2007 and the US FDA issued a warning letter in 2009; related approved drugs exist for other uses."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["They are sold online and in some gyms and salons rather than through licensed channels. Users typically report combining them with some sun or UV exposure to bring colour in, with a gradual darkening over weeks."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Reported effects include flushing and nausea, and mole darkening or other mole changes; a 2009 BMJ report linked an unlicensed tan jab to mole changes. The melanoma evidence is unclear. They are unlicensed for tanning, products are unregulated, and agencies advise against use."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Change in moles linked to use of unlicensed \"sun tan jab\".","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19174439/","source":"BMJ (Clinical research ed.)","year":2009,"cites":22,"kind":null}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Melanotan 2 Risk VS Reward?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/melanotan-2-risk-vs-reward.1771201/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228034959/https://looksmax.org/threads/melanotan-2-risk-vs-reward.1771201/"},{"title":"Melanotan 1 with freckles","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/melanotan-1-with-freckles.1750681/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260109111426/https://looksmax.org/threads/melanotan-1-with-freckles.1750681/"}